{"title": "Second Marriage", "pageid": 14784, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Second_Marriage", "categories": ["Misc items", "Common items"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\"> <figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Item_Wand_SummonHusbandStaff_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Item_Wand_SummonHusbandStaff_Faded.png/300px-Item_Wand_SummonHusbandStaff_Faded.png.webp, /w/images/f/fa/Item_Wand_SummonHusbandStaff_Faded.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Second Marriage image\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fa/Item_Wand_SummonHusbandStaff_Faded.png/300px-Item_Wand_SummonHusbandStaff_Faded.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fa/Item_Wand_SummonHusbandStaff_Faded.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Second Marriage</b> is a wand that can be used to summon <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Connor_Vinderblad\" title=\"Connor Vinderblad\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Portrait_Connor_Vinderblad.png/25px-Portrait_Connor_Vinderblad.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/12/Portrait_Connor_Vinderblad.png/38px-Portrait_Connor_Vinderblad.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/12/Portrait_Connor_Vinderblad.png/50px-Portrait_Connor_Vinderblad.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Connor Vinderblad\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/12/Portrait_Connor_Vinderblad.png/25px-Portrait_Connor_Vinderblad.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/12/Portrait_Connor_Vinderblad.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Connor_Vinderblad\" title=\"Connor Vinderblad\">Connor Vinderblad</a> as an undead thrall.\n\n</p>\n<div style=\"font-size:110%; font-family:'Linux Libertine', 'Georgia', serif; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div style=\"opacity: 0.5; margin: 0.5em 0.5em 0.5em 0;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/36px-Description_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Description_Icon.png/24px-Description_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Description_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></div>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-blockquote-text\" style=\"width:100px; flex-grow: 1; font-style: italic;\">\n<p>Clumps of hair and flesh stick out from the twisted roots that make up the shaft of this wand. 'Connor' is scratched into the surface.\n</p>\n</div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Miscellaneous Items\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fe/Options_Icon.png/25px-Options_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fe/Options_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Miscellaneous\" title=\"Miscellaneous\">Miscellaneous It