" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Animate_Dead_Zombie_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Second_Marriage_(class_action)\" title=\"Second Marriage (class action)\">Second Marriage</a> (<span aria-label=\"Action\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/35px-Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/46px-Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Action\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f2/Action_Icon.png/23px-Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/f2/Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span>)</dt>\n<dd>Summon the remains of <a href=\"/wiki/Mayrina\" title=\"Mayrina\">Mayrina</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/Connor_Vinderblad\" title=\"Connor Vinderblad\">husband</a>. </dd>\n</dl> \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Transformed from <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bitter_Divorce\" title=\"Bitter Divorce\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Item_Wand_SummonHusbandStaff_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Item_Wand_SummonHusbandStaff_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Item_Wand_SummonHusbandStaff_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Item_Wand_SummonHusbandStaff_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Item_Wand_SummonHusbandStaff_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Item_Wand_Sum